# Asset provenance

- Record pack, archive, source blend/texture, production object/material, and modification type for production substitutions.
- Never delete purchased source archives.
- Never permanently overwrite vendor source files.
- Silent skip of a required purchased asset is a defect. Fail closed with an explicit error.
- EcoKit, Botaniq, Forest Nature Kit, HDRI packs, and other owned libraries remain reusable even when a specific implementation is hidden from camera.
